<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>登录 · 银河图书馆</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/admin.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="login">
  <div class="login__card">
    <div class="login__brand">
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="#4FC1E0" stroke-width="1.1" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8.2"></circle>
        <ellipse cx="10" cy="10" rx="8.2" ry="3.1"></ellipse>
        <path d="M10 1.8v16.4"></path>
      </svg>
      <span class="login__title">银河图书馆</span>
    </div>
    <div class="login__sub">Library Console</div>

    {% if expired %}
      <div class="flash flash--warn">登录状态已失效，请重新登录。</div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if error %}
      <div class="flash flash--err">{{ error }}</div>
    {% endif %}

    <form method="post" action="/admin/login" autocomplete="off">
      <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf }}">

      <div class="field">
        <label for="username">用户名</label>
        <input id="username" name="username" type="text" value="{{ username }}" required maxlength="64" autofocus>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="password">口令</label>
        <input id="password" name="password" type="password" required minlength="1" autocomplete="current-password">
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="totp">动态验证码<span class="dim">（未绑定可留空）</span></label>
        <input id="totp" name="totp" type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="8" autocomplete="one-time-code">
      </div>

      <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">登录</button>
    </form>

    <div class="login__foot">
      仅供运营人员使用。账号由管理员在服务器上创建，不开放注册。<br>
      连续输错 5 次将锁定 15 分钟。
      <span class="login__legal">
        成都荒启文化传播有限公司 · 统一社会信用代码
        <span class="mono">91510100MAEY15D64X</span> ·
        <a href="https://beian.miit.gov.cn/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">蜀ICP备2025169184号-1</a>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
